# Line endings, settled once.
#
# There was no .gitattributes and core.autocrlf was unset, so every checkout
# on Windows rewrote every file to CRLF while the repository held LF. The
# result: `git diff` against main reported 8,599 insertions and 8,599
# deletions across 18 files -- exactly equal, every line, no real change --
# merges aborted with "local changes would be overwritten", and a fast-forward
# that should have been trivial failed.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` normalises to LF in the repository and checks out LF
# everywhere. Every editor and toolchain this project uses handles LF on
# Windows; the only thing that ever wanted CRLF was Notepad.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.avif  binary
*.ico   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.webm  binary
*.mp3   binary
*.wav   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.pdf   binary

# Generated. Collapsed in diffs and left out of language stats, because a
# lockfile conflict is resolved by re-running the install, never by hand.
bun.lock linguist-generated=true -diff
